{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chaotic Co-op Firefighting!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0d 2-Player Co-op: </strong>play alone or with a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcccYour Mission:</strong> Beat levels with perfect teamwork and speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25<strong>The Catch:</strong> Tackle unique levels filled with traps, fire and dangerous locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude93<strong>The Solution:</strong> Coordinate with your partner, use your tools, and think fast.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddef<strong>Extinguish</strong> all the flames and reach the exit to succeed. <strong>Explore</strong> multiple locations, each with its own set of challenging stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2757\ufe0f<strong>Teamwork or Chaos:</strong> Coordinate with a friend to carry the survivor, maneuver stretchers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2b50\ufe0f Master the Mission:</strong> Earn 3 stars on each level by beating the clock, saving everyone and putting out all the fires!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981630/extras/72371a7ce8faa2e9ceb0539a4d7250bf.poster.avif?t=1760635917\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981630/extras/72371a7ce8faa2e9ceb0539a4d7250bf.webm?t=1760635917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981630/extras/72371a7ce8faa2e9ceb0539a4d7250bf.mp4?t=1760635917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3981630?t=1760635917","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3981630?t=1760635917","capsule_ima